<div class="crumbs"><div class="wrap"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>&rsaquo;</span> <b>Tire &amp; Wheel Packages</b></div></div>
<section class="pk-hero pk-hero--photo" role="img" aria-label="Tire and wheel packages on the shop floor at American Tire Stores, with a pickup on the lift behind"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="pk-hero__copy">
    <div class="sec-eye">Packages &middot; tires + wheels together</div>
    <h1>Tire and Wheel Packages<span>Sized to your vehicle, fitted in one visit</span></h1>
    <p class="lead"><b>A tire and wheel package is a set of four wheels and four tires specified together
      for one vehicle, then mounted, balanced and fitted as a single job.</b> Because the wheel and the
      tire are chosen at the same time, the fitment is worked out once &mdash; by the people who will fit it.</p>
    <div class="pk-hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn-red" href="#pkg-widget" onclick="jump('pkg-widget');return false;">Build a package &rarr;</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#pkg-use" onclick="jump('pkg-use');return false;">Shop by build</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div></section>

<section class="block" id="pkg-use"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Shop by build</div><h2>What Is the Vehicle For?</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">Start with how the vehicle gets used &mdash; that decides
      load rating, tread and sizing far more than which brand you pick.</p></div>
  <div class="pk-use"><div class="pk-card"><div class="pk-card__media"><div class="pk-card__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-05-e56909c43bc7d02a.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Toyota Tacoma on a rocky mountain trail fitted with bronze off-road wheels and all-terrain tires" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><span class="pk-card__label"><span class="pk-card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 17h20M4 17l2-6h12l2 6"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="17.5" r="2.4"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="17.5" r="2.4"/><path d="M8 11V7l4-2 4 2v4"/></svg></span><span><h3>Off-Road Packages</h3><span class="pk-card__sub">Trail, overland and lifted trucks</span></span></span></div><div class="pk-card__body"><p>Load-rated wheels paired with all-terrain or mud-terrain tires, checked for clearance at full lock and full articulation.</p><ul class="pk-spec"><li>Load-rated for heavier wheels and tires</li><li>Clearance checked against lift and suspension</li><li>All-terrain, mud-terrain and rugged-terrain options</li></ul><a class="pk-card__go" href="#pkg-widget" data-build="offroad" onclick="pickBuild('offroad','off-road');return false;">Start with your vehicle &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="pk-card"><div class="pk-card__media"><div class="pk-card__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-06-51d2723f63261baa.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Yellow Chevrolet Corvette at sunset beside a black machined-face wheel and performance tire" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><span class="pk-card__label"><span class="pk-card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 4.5 13.5H11l-1 8.5 8.5-11.5H12z"/></svg></span><span><h3>Performance Packages</h3><span class="pk-card__sub">Sport sedans and coupes</span></span></span></div><div class="pk-card__body"><p>Lighter wheels and summer or all-season performance tires, matched so unsprung weight and rolling diameter stay where the manufacturer intended.</p><ul class="pk-spec"><li>Rolling diameter matched to keep the speedometer honest</li><li>Lighter forged and flow-formed options</li><li>Summer and all-season performance compounds</li></ul><a class="pk-card__go" href="#pkg-widget" data-build="perf" onclick="pickBuild('perf','performance');return false;">Start with your vehicle &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="pk-card"><div class="pk-card__media"><div class="pk-card__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-07-a52d92f2249b86a0.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Ram heavy-duty pickup on a job site fitted with gray off-road wheels and highway-terrain tires" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><span class="pk-card__label"><span class="pk-card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6h11v10H2zM13 9h4.5l3 3.5V16H13z"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></span><span><h3>Truck Packages</h3><span class="pk-card__sub">Half-ton and heavy-duty pickups</span></span></span></div><div class="pk-card__body"><p>Wheels and tires rated for towing and payload, with the load index confirmed against what your truck is actually asked to carry.</p><ul class="pk-spec"><li>Load index matched to towing and payload</li><li>Correct offset for factory and aftermarket arches</li><li>Highway, all-terrain and commercial tread patterns</li></ul><a class="pk-card__go" href="#pkg-widget" data-build="truck" onclick="pickBuild('truck','truck');return false;">Start with your vehicle &rarr;</a></div></div><div class="pk-card"><div class="pk-card__media"><div class="pk-card__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-08-2487c77c92ce0a40.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Kia Telluride on a suburban street beside a silver alloy wheel and touring tire" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><span class="pk-card__label"><span class="pk-card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 13.5 5 8h14l2 5.5V18h-3.5M3 13.5V18h3.5M3 13.5h18"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="1.9"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="18" r="1.9"/></svg></span><span><h3>Daily Driver Packages</h3><span class="pk-card__sub">Sedans, crossovers and family SUVs</span></span></span></div><div class="pk-card__body"><p>A straightforward upgrade in looks or a like-for-like replacement, sized to factory spec so ride and handling stay familiar.</p><ul class="pk-spec"><li>Sized to factory spec unless you want otherwise</li><li>All-season and touring tires for year-round use</li><li>Plus-sizing available with fitment confirmed first</li></ul><a class="pk-card__go" href="#pkg-widget" data-build="daily" onclick="pickBuild('daily','daily driver');return false;">Start with your vehicle &rarr;</a></div></div></div>
</div></section>

