</div></section>

<section class="block"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Every package includes</div><h2>Fitted Properly, Start to Finish</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">The same four things happen on every package we fit.
      They are in the price, not added at the counter.</p></div>
  <div class="incl-grid">
    <div class="incl-card"><div class="ic-ic"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-09-ed5267d6b7cafa80.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Mount &amp; balance</h3><p>Each wheel is mounted and precision-balanced so the set spins true at speed &mdash; no vibration through the wheel.</p></div></div>
    <div class="incl-card"><div class="ic-ic"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-10-66ef4aa61421efbf.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>TPMS reset</h3><p>Tire pressure sensors are re-synced so the dashboard warning works correctly with the new setup.</p></div></div>
    <div class="incl-card"><div class="ic-ic"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-11-db631b8db99ea872.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Torque to spec</h3><p>Lug nuts are tightened to the exact manufacturer value &mdash; even clamping, nothing over or under.</p></div></div>
    <div class="incl-card"><div class="ic-ic"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-12-9bb4cb670f1b3cdf.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><h3>Fitment verified</h3><p>Bolt pattern, offset, center bore and clearance are confirmed for your vehicle before we order.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="block alt" id="pkg-brands"><div class="wrap">
