<section class="block pk-blue"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Good to know</div><h2>Why Buy Tires and Wheels Together?</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">It is not only about the discount. Buying the set as one
      job removes the three things that most often go wrong when they are bought separately.</p></div>
  <div class="pk-why">
    <div><h3>Fitment is solved once</h3><p>Offset, backspacing and center bore have to agree with each other
      <em>and</em> with the vehicle. When the wheel and tire are specified together, that is one calculation
      by one person &mdash; not a guess made twice.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Rolling diameter stays right</h3><p>Go up a wheel size and the tire has to come down in
      sidewall to keep the overall diameter close to stock. Get it wrong and the speedometer reads wrong and
      ABS and traction control work from bad numbers.</p></div>
    <div><h3>It arrives ready to fit</h3><p>Packages are mounted and balanced before you arrive, so the
      appointment is a wheel swap rather than a build. Less time on the ramp, and nothing discovered halfway
      through the job.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="block alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="pk-fin">
    <div class="pk-fin__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-13-5d14d7a6bf9ee159.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Financing available on tire and wheel packages"
      width="1200" height="280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
    <div class="pk-fin__body">
