<section class="block"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">How it works</div><h2>From Vehicle to Fitted &mdash; in 4 Steps</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:15px">Most of it happens before you arrive, which is why the
      appointment itself is short.</p></div>
  <div class="pk-steps"><div class="pk-step"><div class="pk-step__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-14-567dc1f638dc31ef.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A customer checking options on a phone beside her vehicle" width="400" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pk-step__n">1</span></div><div class="pk-step__body"><h3>Pick your store and vehicle</h3><p>Fitment depends on the exact year, make, model and trim. Choosing a store at the same time means you are seeing what is available near you.</p></div></div><div class="pk-step"><div class="pk-step__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-15-6f6ba074c4cca512.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="A customer and an advisor going through options on a tablet at the service counter" width="400" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pk-step__n">2</span></div><div class="pk-step__body"><h3>Choose the tire and the wheel</h3><p>The builder shows the combinations that fit the vehicle you entered, at the fitment levels the store has enabled &mdash; so you cannot build something that will not bolt on.</p></div></div><div class="pk-step"><div class="pk-step__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-16-d566ceb4562fc3f3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="An advisor showing a customer a quote while a technician works on the vehicle" width="400" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pk-step__n">3</span></div><div class="pk-step__body"><h3>Review the out-the-door price</h3><p>The builder quotes the set as a single figure, with financing available if you want it. Check what that figure covers at your store before comparing it against parts-only prices elsewhere.</p></div></div><div class="pk-step"><div class="pk-step__img"><img src="{{ 'netlify-packages-source-17-b343511ed4ae935a.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="An advisor handing car keys back to a customer beside her vehicle" width="400" height="260" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pk-step__n">4</span></div><div class="pk-step__body"><h3>Book the fit</h3><p>Bring the vehicle in. The package is mounted, balanced and torqued to spec, and the TPMS is re-synced before you leave.</p></div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="block alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">What drivers say</div><h2>Package Customer Reviews</h2></div>
  <div class="wh-rev"><div class="wh-rev-card"><div class="wh-rev-top"><span class="wh-rev-av">P</span><span><span class="wh-rev-name">Package fitted at Ventura</span><span class="wh-rev-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></span></div><p>&ldquo;The advisor talked me out of the wheel I came in for because the offset was wrong for my truck, and showed me why. Ended up with a set that actually clears.&rdquo;</p></div><div class="wh-rev-card"><div class="wh-rev-top"><span class="wh-rev-av">P</span><span><span class="wh-rev-name">Package fitted at Bellflower</span><span class="wh-rev-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></span></div><p>&ldquo;Priced the wheels and tires separately somewhere else and it came out higher once fitting was added. Here it was one number.&rdquo;</p></div><div class="wh-rev-card"><div class="wh-rev-top"><span class="wh-rev-av">P</span><span><span class="wh-rev-name">Package fitted at Glendale</span><span class="wh-rev-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span></span></div><p>&ldquo;Booked it in, dropped the truck off, and the whole set was on when I came back. No surprises on the bill.&rdquo;</p></div></div>
