<section class="block" id="pkg-faq"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-eye">Good to know</div><h2>Package FAQ</h2></div>
  <div class="faq"><details class="qa" id="qa0" open><summary><span>What is a tire and wheel package?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>A set of four wheels and four tires specified together for one vehicle, then mounted, balanced and fitted as a single job. Because the wheel and tire are chosen at the same time, the fitment only has to be worked out once.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa1"><summary><span>Is a package cheaper than buying separately?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Not automatically. Package-level promotions apply to the set, and the builder quotes the whole set as one figure rather than parts alone &mdash; which is the number worth comparing. Ask your store what that figure includes before comparing it against a parts-only price elsewhere.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa2"><summary><span>Will bigger wheels change how my car drives?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. A larger wheel usually means a shorter sidewall, which firms up the ride and makes the steering feel sharper but transmits more road surface. Keeping overall rolling diameter close to stock keeps the speedometer and traction control accurate.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa3"><summary><span>Do I need new TPMS sensors?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>It depends on the vehicle and the wheels. Some wheels take your existing sensors, others need new ones. An advisor will tell you before the order is placed rather than after.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa4"><summary><span>Can I use my existing tires with new wheels?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Sometimes &mdash; if the tire size suits the new wheel width and the tires have enough tread left to be worth remounting. We will measure and tell you honestly whether it is worth it.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa5"><summary><span>How long does fitting take?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Packages arrive already mounted and balanced, so the appointment is a wheel swap rather than a build. Call your store for current timings on your vehicle.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa6"><summary><span>Can I finance a package?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Financing with $0 down is available through our financing partner. See the financing page for how it works.</p></div></details><details class="qa" id="qa7"><summary><span>Do you fit packages bought elsewhere?</span><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="a"><p>Call the store. It depends on the wheel, the tire and whether we can stand behind the fitment &mdash; an advisor will give you a straight answer.</p></div></details></div>
</div></section>

